# Travel summary

The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR[[cite:obs-f884e4ad587dcdd60f1239ff41b79bbfb8086e8d "The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR."]]. Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director[[cite:obs-b3ed6078dd5b648984e824229e729a2a8aae980b "Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director."]].
